<title>UK: Whitbread sells Richardsons Inns.</title>
<headline>Whitbread sells Richardsons Inns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British leisure group Whitbread Plc said on Monday it had agreed to sell its Richardsons Inns business to Surrey Free Inns Plc for 10.85 million stg.</p>
<p>Whitbread said the sale included seven properties. Gerals Richardson, who manages the operating side of the Richardsons Inns partnership, will join the board of Surrey Free Inns, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
